  "body": "Positioned in the heart of sought-after Takapuna, this solid brick home on a concrete foundation offers a rare combination of durability, low-maintenance living, and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\n\r\nConfigured as two bedrooms and one bathroom, the home features a modern kitchen and a well-proportioned living space that flows effortlessly to a private, quiet backyard - perfect for relaxing or entertaining. A generous front yard adds further flexibility, creating space to enjoy outdoor living in your own way.\r\n\r\n\r\nBuilt from dependable brick construction, this is a home designed to last, offering peace of mind for years to come and appealing to buyers seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle or a smart long-term investment.\r\n\r\n\r\nLocation is where this property truly shines. Set within Takapuna’s top-tier school zones, and just minutes’ walk to the lakefront of Lake Pupuke, you can enjoy peaceful afternoon strolls, nearby parks, and the charm of the PumpHouse Theatre. Head the other direction, and you’re moments from the golden sands of Takapuna Beach — perfect for a morning coffee, an evening walk, or simply soaking in the coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\n\r\nTakapuna town centre is also within easy reach, placing shops, cafés, and daily essentials right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\n\r\nHomes offering this level of construction, location, and lifestyle are always in demand.\r\n\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.",
